ll project in Godot and noticed some gizmos not being rendered, and pretty much all other meshes aren't being drawn either.\nI guess this happened after a windows update, I really don't know. It's the first time in a while I opened Godot again.\nThis is kind of beyond me so hence why I'm opening an issue, hoping someone knows more.\n\nA new empty project with a single mesh instance (gizmos and mesh completely missing, including from the mesh resource preview):\n<img width=\"2550\" height=\"1369\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9577782d-9726-42c6-942d-a3dfaaaf5ea9\" />\n\nA decent scene with a lot more going on like meshes, navigation and collision:\n<img width=\"1913\" height=\"823\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95aa1731-5d3f-4735-8e14-1db23ed2c2b8\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Make a new scene\n2. Notice gizmos missing\n3. Make a mesh instance with any mesh\n4. Observe it not rendering and missing 3d gizmos\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIt happens on every project, even a basic one that does not contain nodes the root's gizmos are missing...","closed_by":{"login":"Duckxz","id":49942153,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTQyMTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49942153?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz","html_url":"https://github.com/Duckxz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Duckxz/receive